{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110703001:1":{"text":"布鲁特斯大人。您认为此时此刻，在一场公平的决斗中，您会输给阿尔萨和我吗？","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人。您认为此时此刻，在一场公平的决斗中，您会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76180E9FA6F6B4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110703002:1":{"text":"我从未那么想过。索恩，阿尔萨，你们是你们这个年纪的强者。","source_cn":"我从未那么想过。索恩，阿尔萨，你们是你们这个年纪的强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F7C6F2FCBB041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110703003:1":{"text":"但若想锤炼最完美的战斗直觉，经验必不可少，这绝非一朝一夕可以告成。","source_cn":"但若想锤炼最完美的战斗直觉，经验必不可少，这绝非一朝一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3632331FAB21D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110703004:1":{"text":"我们也是这么想的。战歌节胜者这一称号，对现在的我们来说，还太过沉重。","source_cn":"我们也是这么想的。战歌节胜者这一称号，对现在的我们来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A95145AEF346EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110703005:1":{"text":"没错，虽然我们是有偷偷幻想过啦……但在我心中、在索恩心中、在大家心中——","source_cn":"没错，虽然我们是有偷偷幻想过啦……但在我心中、在索恩心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EE809B19EA516BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"",